{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "EPH",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, to the saints who are at Ephesus, and to the faithful in Christ Jesus:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you, and peace from God our Father, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who hath blessed us with all spiritual blessings in heavenly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "places",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "According as he hath chosen us in him, before the foundation of the world, that we should be holy and without blame before him in love:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having predestinated us to the adoption of children to himself by Jesus Christ, according to the good pleasure of his will,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the praise of the glory of his grace, in which he hath made us accepted in the beloved:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In whom we have redemption through his blood, the forgiveness of sins, according to the riches of his grace;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In which he hath abounded towards us in all wisdom and prudence;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Having made known to us the mystery of his will, according to his good pleasure which he hath purposed in himself:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That in the dispensation of the fullness of times he might collect in one all things in Christ, both which are in heaven, and which are on earth; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In whom also we have obtained an inheritance, being predestinated according to the purpose of him who worketh all things after the counsel of his own will:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That we should be to the praise of his glory, who first trusted in Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In whom ye also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "trusted",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", after ye heard the word of truth, the gospel of your salvation: in whom also after ye believed, ye were sealed with that holy Spirit of promise,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which is the earnest of our inheritance until the redemption of the purchased possession, to the praise of his glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore I also, having heard of your faith in the Lord Jesus, and love to all the saints,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cease not to give thanks for you, making mention of you in my prayers;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That the God of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Father of glory, may give to you the spirit of wisdom and revelation in the knowledge of him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eyes of your understanding being enlightened; that ye may know what is the hope of his calling, and what the riches of the glory of his inheritance in the saints,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And what ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the exceeding greatness of his power toward us who believe, according to the working of his mighty power,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which he wrought in Christ, when he raised him from the dead, and set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at his own right hand in the heavenly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "places",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Far above all principality, and power, and might, and dominion, and every name that is named, not only in this world, but also in that which is to come:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And put all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " under his feet, and gave him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the head over all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the church,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.1.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.1.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which is his body, the fullness of him that filleth all in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
